You're under arrest for being
suspicious people, datchu!

00:20:27.659 --> 00:20:30.772
Hey, what's with the big talk?

00:20:30.796 --> 00:20:32.730
Mami, she's just a kid.

00:20:33.465 --> 00:20:35.399
Yeah, you're right. Oh, well.

00:20:35.767 --> 00:20:38.646
Don't make fun of me, datchu!

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:40.315
Not yet, chu!

00:20:40.339 --> 00:20:42.417
You're a tough opponent, chu!

00:20:42.441 --> 00:20:44.485
You ain't seen nothing yet, chu!

00:20:44.509 --> 00:20:46.238
Still not giving up, chu?!

00:20:46.778 --> 00:20:48.268
This'll be the finishing blow, datchu!

00:20:49.014 --> 00:20:51.449
Are you okay, Detective Kotobuki?!
Detective Kotobuki!

00:20:52.184 --> 00:20:54.050
Hey, you're Kotobuki?

00:20:54.653 --> 00:20:56.931
As in Ran Kotobuki's kid sister?

00:20:56.955 --> 00:20:58.582
Hold it right there!

00:21:00.759 --> 00:21:01.669
Kotobuki!

00:21:01.693 --> 00:21:02.270
Sis!
Kotobuki!

00:21:02.294 --> 00:21:02.604
Sis!

00:21:02.628 --> 00:21:03.238
Sis!
Senior Kotobuki!

00:21:03.262 --> 00:21:03.905
Senior Kotobuki!

00:21:03.929 --> 00:21:07.297
Honda, you sure pulled off a bunch
of cheap tricks while I was gone!

00:21:08.133 --> 00:21:10.044
You're not so hot yourself

00:21:10.068 --> 00:21:12.146
if you can't even protect your own turf
without always being around.

00:21:12.170 --> 00:21:13.815
If you want to call yourself
the leader of Shibuya,

00:21:13.839 --> 00:21:15.383
you better do it after
you've defeated me!

00:21:15.407 --> 00:21:19.020
Quit scurrying around my back and
come at me fair and square!

00:21:19.044 --> 00:21:20.910
Yeah, I'll do that.

00:21:21.913 --> 00:21:26.427
Anyone who uses props like that is
as good as saying they're weak!

00:21:26.451 --> 00:21:29.477
Let's see if you can still say that
after you've had a taste of this!

00:21:38.964 --> 00:21:43.745
Kotobuki, you big jerk!

00:21:43.769 --> 00:21:45.259
Wait, Mami!

00:21:46.872 --> 00:21:48.516
Sis!

00:21:48.540 --> 00:21:53.444
Sayo, Masato, you did well to
protect the peace of Shibuya.

00:21:55.647 --> 00:21:57.137
Ran!

00:21:58.283 --> 00:21:59.761
Did you find Sayo?

00:21:59.785 --> 00:22:01.529
| saw the Bukuro girls running away.

00:22:01.553 --> 00:22:03.817
That rumor was just a bunch
of BS after all.

00:22:04.289 --> 00:22:05.500
You bet!

00:22:05.524 --> 00:22:09.085
| won't let them have free run of
Shibuya as long as I'm here!

00:22:11.630 --> 00:22:14.142
Hey, Ran, what's that?

00:22:14.166 --> 00:22:15.376
This?

00:22:15.400 --> 00:22:17.368
A red marker?

00:22:17.769 --> 00:22:21.582
Damn that Kotobuki, I'll get back
at her for this someday!

00:22:21.606 --> 00:22:24.619
Mami, saying that with that face
only makes you look stupid.

00:22:24.643 --> 00:22:27.155
It's permanent marker!
It won't come off!

00:22:27.179 --> 00:22:30.171
Damn it! Kotobuki!
Just you remember this!

00:22:30.949 --> 00:22:32.293
I'll forget about it right away.

00:22:32.317 --> 00:22:34.285
Datchu!

00:22:35.754 --> 00:22:41.887
| hate it, you're always laughing

00:22:42.294 --> 00:22:48.097
And so strong and cute and popular

00:22:48.533 --> 00:22:54.882
| hate it, I'm so dull and slow

00:22:54.906 --> 00:23:00.174
And no one needs me...

00:23:01.146 --> 00:23:07.428
You're smart and always so perfect

00:23:07.452 --> 00:23:13.221
People probably just make fun of me

00:23:13.792 --> 00:23:20.108
To be honest, I want to try talking to you

00:23:20.132 --> 00:23:25.813
| want to become friends with you

00:23:25.837 --> 00:23:31.799
| was so envious of you

00:23:32.177 --> 00:23:37.759
And my shoulders would tremble as I cried alone

00:23:37.783 --> 00:23:45.299
Tell me, are you alone and afraid too?

00:23:45.323 --> 00:23:51.272
Is everyone miserable and weak?

00:23:51.296 --> 00:23:57.945
If only I had more courage

00:23:57.969 --> 00:24:04.375
| would have given you a hug

00:24:05.410 --> 00:24:06.754
Next Super GALS!

00:24:06.778 --> 00:24:08.523
Next Super GALS!
The emails just keep coming, prank emails!

00:24:08.547 --> 00:24:08.923
Next Super GALS!
Prank emails are being sent to Miyu's cell.

00:24:08.947 --> 00:24:10.540
Prank emails are being sent to Miyu's cell.

00:24:11.016 --> 00:24:11.726
Let's see, it says,

00:24:11.750 --> 00:24:13.861
"Miyu Yamazaki is the former
leader of the Resistance

00:24:13.885 --> 00:24:14.829
and a diabolical person."

00:24:14.853 --> 00:24:17.632
“I'll make sure everyone finds out
about the evil things you did!"

00:24:17.656 --> 00:24:19.767
Looks like it's the handiwork of
someone who's got a grudge

00:24:19.791 --> 00:24:21.102
against Miyu from back when
she was in a gang.

00:24:21.126 --> 00:24:22.570
| don't know what the grudge is about,

00:24:22.594 --> 00:24:24.756
but if you've got a problem,
bring it up fair and square!

